sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant V as UsageView(Vue)
    participant A as defineAsyncComponent
    participant C as api/client.ts
    participant S as api/stats.ts
    participant H as panel.stats (withAuth + cachedRead 60s)
    participant M as usage.Stats (只读)
    participant P as useChartPalette
    participant E as ECharts(Canvas)

    U->>V: 切换到「用量」视图 / 改时间维度 / 改 realm
    V->>A: 懒加载 TrendChart / HeatmapChart / BreakdownChart
    A-->>V: 独立 echarts chunk（633kB，主包 731kB）
    V->>S: statsRangeFromState({preset, from, to}) → statsParams(range)
    S->>C: api('stats/timeseries'|'stats/heatmap'|'stats/breakdown')
    C->>C: Bearer + GET 在途合并 + 15s 超时
    C->>H: GET /panel/api/stats/* (同源)
    H->>H: withAuth + cachedRead(60s)
    H->>M: SeriesWindow / Heatmap / SnapshotWindow
    M-->>H: points / 7x24 cells / items（豆包 excluded、opencode 独立桶）
    H-->>C: {..., coverage, excluded, credit_samples, note, generated}
    C-->>S: 类型化响应
    S-->>V: TimeseriesResponse / HeatmapResponse / BreakdownResponse

    V->>P: readChartPalette()（getComputedStyle 读 tokens.css）
    P-->>V: --accent/--ok/--warn/--bad/--line/--ink-*
    V->>E: setOption(trendOption/heatmapOption/breakdownOption, notMerge:true)
    E-->>U: Canvas 渲染（禁 echarts-gl / eval / new Function / 内联脚本）

    opt 切换明暗主题
        U->>V: 顶栏主题切换（wb2api.theme）
        V->>P: MutationObserver 监听 html[data-theme|theme-mode]
        P-->>V: 新令牌
        V->>E: setOption(newOption, true) 重绘
    end
    opt 数据降级透明提示
        V-->>U: missing_intervals「补零，非真实 0」/ days_without_hour_data「不参与着色」
        V-->>U: excluded「豆包未计入」/ credit_samples=0「上游未回该维度，非积分为 0」
    end
    Note over U,E: Wails WebView 与浏览器加载同一 /panel/，图表行为一致
    Note over E: 写请求后 withAuth 清缓存 → 视图 refresh() 重拉三图
